# Website QA Checklist (always enforce)

Before finishing any site, content, SEO, product, or checkout change on this project, verify **all** items below. If any fail, fix them before ending the turn. Prefer running `node scripts/qa-checklist.mjs` after `npm run build`.

## Checklist

1. **Whole build clean** — `npm run build` succeeds; no build errors, no broken pages in the route list.
2. **sitemap.xml and robots.txt** — live in `dist/` (and `public/robots.txt`); sitemap lists every public indexable page; robots points at the sitemap and does not block important pages.
3. **Store / affiliate links** — Buy / Get access CTAs go to `https://zadeyo.com/go/QRH?to=%2Fproducts%2Fdelta-force`; HWID Spoofer buy goes to `...%2Fproducts%2Fhwid-spoofer`; no wrong-game checkout destinations.
4. **Original copy** — no placeholder text (`lorem`, `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder`, `Coming soon` as fake content); no leftover Rust / Facepunch / Dota / wrong-domain user-facing copy.
5. **Pages load desktop + mobile** — layouts remain usable; no hero/nav/footer broken at common breakpoints; video/player controls remain usable.
6. **Unique SEO per page** — every route has its own title, meta description, and exactly one `h1` (via `pageSeo` / product / blog data).
7. **Images** — gameplay/blog images are optimized (webp variants where the pipeline expects them) and every meaningful `<img>` / `ResponsiveImage` has descriptive alt text.

## Domain / brand invariants

- Domain: `deltaforce-cheats.net`
- Brand: Delta Force Cheats
- Product base: `/products/deltaforce-cheats/`
- No user-facing leftovers of other games except intentional legacy redirect **source** paths.
